# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Client build configuration (Vite). Copy to .env.local to override locally.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Leave both variables unset for local development (proxy mode): the client
# talks to the Node dev server at http://localhost:3001 (REST + WebSocket),
# which proxies the cloud ledger and hosts the LLM/MCP assistant.
#
# Client-only build (GitHub Pages) — two endpoints:
#   VITE_CDN_BASE_URL  GET /api/v1/ticks/* via CloudFront (14s edge cache
#                      shields the 1-RCU DynamoDB table)
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL  all other dynamic routes (portfolio, trades, orders,
#                      transfers, assistant) hit the HTTP API Gateway directly —
#                      bypassing CloudFront fixes CORS and enables zero-buffered
#                      LLM text streaming
VITE_CDN_BASE_URL=
VITE_API_BASE_URL=

# Optional overrides:
# -------------------

# WebSocket endpoint. Proxy-mode default: ws://localhost:3001. Direct mode has
# no WebSocket through the CloudFront HTTP distribution — leave empty.
# VITE_WS_URL=ws://localhost:3001

# Assistant (chat) endpoint. Defaults per mode:
#   proxy:  <base>/api/assistant     (Node dev server)
#   direct: <base>/api/v1/assistant  (Lambda, forward-compatible)
# VITE_ASSISTANT_URL=
